 "mapping": {
  "author": "claude-fixer-a695",
  "date": "2026-11-13",
  "draft_py": "# Vivien, Nature's Avenger. The compiler composes the -1 (the B13 loyalty frame around B16's\n# \"Reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a creature card.\", with B16's \"Put\n# that card into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.\" as its\n# trailing sentence). The +1 is Basri Ket's +1 with three counters (B5c-loyalty-put-counter); the\n# -6 is Garruk, Unleashed's +1 with a single target and +10/+10 (B5c-loyalty-pt-trample).\ncreature = FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature')\nbattlefield = (Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),)\nplus_one = ActivatedAbility(\n    cost=Cost(parts=(CostLoyalty(delta=1),)),\n    effect=A(Verb.PUT_COUNTER, {\n        'count': QConst(value=3),\n        'counter_kind': CounterKind.PLUS_1_PLUS_1,\n        'target': Selector(count=QAtMost(n=1), mode=SelectorMode.TARGET, filter=creature,\n                           zones=battlefield),\n    }),\n)\ntarget_creature = Selector(count=QConst(value=1), mode=SelectorMode.TARGET, filter=creature,\n                           zones=battlefield)\nminus_six = ActivatedAbility(\n    cost=Cost(parts=(CostLoyalty(delta=-6),)),\n    effect=Seq(steps=(\n        A(Verb.MODIFY_PT, {\n            'duration': DurationEot(),\n            'power': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.INCREASE, magnitude=QConst(value=10)),\n            'target': target_creature,\n            'toughness': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.INCREASE, magnitude=QConst(value=10)),\n        }),\n        A(Verb.GRANT_ABILITY, {\n            'ability': KeywordAbility(keyword=Keyword.TRAMPLE),\n            'duration': DurationEot(),\n            'target': target_creature,\n        }),\n    )),\n)\nminus_one, carrier = compiled\nabilities = [plus_one, minus_one, minus_six, carrier]\n",
  "clauses": [
   {
    "clause": "[+1]: Put three +1/+1 counters on up to one target creature.",
    "ir": "abilities[0]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "[−1]: Reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a creature card.",
    "ir": "abilities[1].cost, abilities[1].effect.steps[0]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "Put that card into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.",
    "ir": "abilities[1].effect.steps[1]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "[−6]: Target creature gets +10/+10 and gains trample until end of turn.",
    "ir": "abilities[2]"
   }
  ],
  "g0_warnings": [],
  "notes": "Was needs-atom (REVEAL-until dig, 2026-11-05; stale since REVEAL.until, round 4, and MOVE_ZONE arrange RANDOM, round 5). templates_b16 compiles the -1 (loyalty frame + reveal-until + 'that card to hand, the rest to the bottom in a random order'); the REVEAL-until now leaves the partition anchors the REST reads after the found card's move closed the look window (verbs._look). The +1 and -6 are mapped here. The dig subtree is byte-identical to FDN Spinner of Souls'. Packs: tools/scenarios/mapped/M20/vivien_*.json."
 },
